# Content Tone

## Voice

Warm, elegant, celebratory, modern, respectful. Emotional but readable — not corporate, not cringe-romantic, not generic AI tone.

## Categories

Couple intros, stories, event descriptions (Mehendi, Haldi, etc.), RSVP messages, welcome notes, headlines, share metadata.

## Personalization

Adapt to template personality, wedding style, and cultural tone — avoid one-size-fits-all phrasing.

## Readability

Short paragraphs; scannable on mobile; no dense text blocks.

## Languages

Default English; support natural **Hinglish**; keep structure flexible for regional languages later.

## SEO / Sharing Metadata

Concise, premium preview text and titles — no keyword stuffing.

## Avoid

Robotic wording, repetitive phrases, overly dramatic exaggeration, outdated formal wedding clichés.

## Priority

Emotional quality → readability → personalization → elegance → clarity
